

The Skupper Console is a web-based graphical interface for 
observing a Skupper network.

It gives you a real-time view of the Virtual Application Network 
so you don't have to inspect individual Custom Resources or 
Router logs.



It shows
---------------------------------------------------------------

Topology	How Sites are linked, and the overall shape 
                of the network

Sites	        Status and details of each site

Links	        Connection state between sites

Services	Listeners and Connectors, and whether they 
                have matching counterparts

Flows	        Application traffic moving across the network 
                (if flow collection is enabled.)

Workloads	Which pods or processes are running





exposed as a Kubernetes Service



